Status: RO
X-Status: 

Cari postmaster italiani,
vi sottopongo un problema di interscambio di mail.
Un utente qui vuole scrivere a un indirizzo non standard, che sembra
puntare a un host UUnet:
        enterprise!forti@forthnet.gr

Mentre quello che sembra il mail gateway accetta il messaggio ............

rsisi root / ->>mailx -v enterprise!forti@forthnet.gr
Subject: test
per favore risponda se riceve questo msg, grazie.
Cc:
/etc/sendmail.cf: line 74: WARNING: writable directory /etc
enterprise!forti@forthnet.gr... Connecting to info.forthnet.gr. via smtp...
220-info.forthnet.gr Sendmail 8.6.12/FORTHNET-2.0 ready at Tue, 3 Sep 1996 11:41
:48 +0300
220 ESMTP spoken here
>>> EHLO rsisi.hsr.it
250-info.forthnet.gr Hello RSISI.HSR.IT [192.167.192.2], pleased to meet you
250-EXPN
250-SIZE
250 HELP
>>> MAIL From:<root@rsisi.hsr.it> SIZE=98
250 <root@rsisi.hsr.it>... Sender ok
>>> RCPT To:<enterprise!forti@forthnet.gr>
250 <enterprise!forti@forthnet.gr>... Recipient ok
>>> DATA
354 Enter mail, end with "." on a line by itself
>>> .
250 LAA23669 Message accepted for delivery
enterprise!forti@forthnet.gr... Sent (LAA23669 Message accepted for delivery)
Closing connection to info.forthnet.gr.
>>> QUIT
221 info.forthnet.gr closing connection

............ quasi subito torna un bel messaggio di errore:

